2. "min=0"
3. "max=100"

Your task is to implement the `parseConstraints` function to achieve the desired functionality.

### Solution:
```java
import java.util.ArrayList;
import java.util.List;

public class ConstraintParser {
    public List<String> parseConstraints(String input) {
        List<String> constraintInfos = new ArrayList<>();

        String[] constraints = input.split(",");
        for (String constraint : constraints) {
            constraintInfos.add(constraint.trim());
        }

        return constraintInfos;
    }
}
```

