### Solution:
To achieve the desired functionality, you can use Angular's reactive forms to handle the input for adding new items and display the list of items. Here's a possible solution using Angular's reactive forms and TypeScript:

```typescript
import { Component, OnInit } from '@angular/core';
import { FormBuilder, FormGroup, Validators } from '@angular/forms';

@Component({
  selector: 'app-item-list',
  templateUrl: './item-list.component.html',
  styleUrls: ['./item-list.component.css']
})
