### Solution:
```java
public class PackageNameExtractor {
    public static String extractPackageName(String filePath) {
        String packagePath = filePath.substring(0, filePath.lastIndexOf(".java")); // Remove ".java" extension
        packagePath = packagePath.replace('/', '.'); // Replace '/' with '.'
        return packagePath;
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
